# The faces this example's fonts are made from at build time: the first family of these that the build machine has,
# with every character a need asks for (DGX's docs/fonts-en.md, "Selection rules"). Sizes are in pixels.
source system
allow "DejaVu Sans"      7..
allow "Liberation Sans"  7..
allow "Noto Sans"        7..
allow "FreeSans"         7..
allow "Arial"            7..
